msgid "KEYBOARD_EXPLAIN"
msgstr "An octave repeats the same note names higher or lower. Keyboard notes use the instrument volume and appear as diamonds on the staff, with outlined frets at the playhead. A ! means no free guitar string can play that note. Notes are not recorded or scored. See Help for the keys."

msgid "KEYBOARD_HELP_LOWER"
