msgid "WELCOME"
msgstr "Quick start"

msgid "CARD_WELCOME"
msgstr "Quick start · Getting started"

msgid "WELCOME_INTRO"
msgstr "An exercise is ready. Start practicing closes this guide; press Play afterward to hear it. LibreTabs does not listen to or grade your guitar playing."

msgid "WELCOME_PRACTICE"
msgstr "Start practicing"

msgid "WELCOME_READ"
msgstr "1. Read the guitar tabs\nThe six lines represent strings: the top is string 1, the thinnest. A number tells you which fret to use, not which finger. Press just behind that metal fret and pluck the string. A 0 means pluck without pressing."

msgid "WELCOME_PLAY"
msgstr "2. Listen once, then join in\nPress Play. The count-in clicks give you time to get ready. Read left to right: open brackets mark upcoming notes, and full outlines mark sounding notes. Space plays or pauses with menus closed."

msgid "WELCOME_PACE"
msgstr "3. Slow down and repeat\nIn Playback (under Menu), try 50% speed: half as fast, with the same pitches. In Loop (under Menu), set From 1 and Through 2, then Turn loop on to repeat those measures. A measure is a group of beats between vertical lines."

msgid "WELCOME_STARTUP"
msgstr "Show on startup"

msgid "WELCOME_STARTUP_HELP"
msgstr "Open Menu, then Quick start any time to return here or turn startup help back on."

msgid "PLAYER_SHORTCUTS"
msgstr "Space always plays or pauses while a menu is closed. Left and Right move by measure, or turn a reading page. Focus the position scrubber for beat-by-beat Arrow keys, Page Up/Down by measure, and Home/End. Escape closes a menu or capture view. F8 toggles capture view. F9 toggles Theater. F10 shows Theater controls without pausing. Tab moves between controls. Swipe across a manual reading page to turn it. Piano keys are listed below."

