msgstr "OBS: add this page as a Browser Source, set its width and height (for example, 1920 × 1080), and use Interact to choose your song and enter capture view. That source has its own song and settings. The score stays on a readable card; the margins can be transparent. For window capture or video editing, choose Green screen and remove that color with a chroma-key filter. Use the player’s sound menu to mute instrument or click as needed. Capture mode never starts playback by itself."

