msgstr "Count-in beat %d. Tap to pause."

msgid "VIEW_FOLLOW_PAGES"
msgstr "Pages · follow playback"

msgid "HELP_HIGHLIGHTS"
msgstr "Open brackets on tabs and staff notes show the next notes, including chords. Full outlines show sounding notes. Small sparks mark note starts when reduced motion is off; they do not grade your playing."

msgid "PAGE_FOLLOW"
msgstr "Follow playback"

msgid "TIP_PAGE_FOLLOW"
msgstr "Turn pages with the music. Turn off to read at your own pace. Swiping or turning a page yourself also turns following off."

